; tests/lit/dialect/populate.check - the handwritten dialect-level shape test
; (the per-record skeletons in pdll/ are generated; this one is the audit of
; the emission's shape itself): the stock mlir-tblgen -gen-rewriters output
; carries exactly 23 pattern structs and wires exactly 23 of them into
; populateWithGenerated.  The per-name bijection ctor <-> pattern <-> populate
; is asserted record-by-record by checks.rules-audit sec. 5; this file guards
; the count and the wiring against a silently empty or padded generation.
; RUN: FileCheck --input-file=%timbda_drr_inc %s
; CHECK-COUNT-23: struct {{Rew[A-Za-z0-9_]+}} : public ::mlir::RewritePattern {
; CHECK: void populateWithGenerated(::mlir::RewritePatternSet &patterns) {
; CHECK-COUNT-23: patterns.add<{{Rew[A-Za-z0-9_]+}}>(patterns.getContext());
; CHECK: }
